{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861680/extras/3bc55b4653346bf669f4b365e385fb2f.avif?t=1755776589\" width=800 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game tells the story of an Anomalist. An anomaly is detected on a planet, and a team is assigned to investigate it\u2014Finn is both the main character and the last member of the team.  Anomaly considers himself to be the most powerful being in his universe and his character's mood can change every time. He can go from being very serious to sarcastic to angry in an instant, and his goal is to have some fun before he assimilates his goals into himself. He aims to mentally exhaust his victims, who are sucked into his dimension, sometimes taking over their senses and sometimes imprisoning them in areas that challenge perception.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861680/extras/96086ca3e7ead67e1cfb2d41c129cc4b.avif?t=1755776589\" width=800 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The choices you make will determine your destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861680/extras/6c5ea6f0a326360cca0dfae75d6ef16e.poster.avif?t=1755776589\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861680/extras/6c5ea6f0a326360cca0dfae75d6ef16e.webm?t=1755776589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861680/extras/6c5ea6f0a326360cca0dfae75d6ef16e.mp4?t=1755776589\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861680/extras/1288fb37682f5b991ae5568114054930.avif?t=1755776589\" width=800 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The choices you make in The Epilogue will change the visual style of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861680/extras/a42e51c2d5f9c59a309c477f4bb50ca5.poster.avif?t=1755776589\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861680/extras/a42e51c2d5f9c59a309c477f4bb50ca5.webm?t=1755776589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861680/extras/a42e51c2d5f9c59a309c477f4bb50ca5.mp4?t=1755776589\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861680/extras/7936fb14cf12e06d4330c5f599c8270e.poster.avif?t=1755776589\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861680/extras/7936fb14cf12e06d4330c5f599c8270e.webm?t=1755776589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861680/extras/421838ccee99b04cb60497ce7af11d70.avif?t=1755776589\" width=800 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Epilogue doesn't just change the visual style with the choices you make, it also offers different gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_